WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Ryu falls beside the corner after the heavy Gou Shoryuken ender.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.250
Akuma whiffs standing jabs to time the next wake-up attack.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.700
Standing medium punch hits as Ryu rises.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.400
Crouching medium punch continues the wake-up confirm.

5
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.700
Light Tatsu launches Ryu into the corner juggle.

6
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.550
Heavy Tatsu catches Ryu before the second knockdown.
